current code, and one-click\";i:3;s:117:\"Snippet deployment from Code Snippets Cloud to connected sites, including deploying several snippets under one shared\";i:4;s:108:\"New admin interface for managing snippets, with a cleaner layout, faster interactions, and a more consistent\";i:5;s:115:\"Admin bar snippet drawer, based on the Deckerweb Snippets workflow, for quick access to snippets and Safe Mode from\";i:6;s:89:\"Snippet locking to help prevent accidental edits or deletion of important snippets. Props\";i:7;s:118:\"Improved screen options on the main snippets table, including controls for visible columns and truncating long snippet\";i:8;s:115:\"Clearer accessibility labels, headings, tab markup, table checkboxes, sort buttons, copy buttons, and drag-and-drop\";i:9;s:113:\"Feedback reporter for sending bug reports, feature requests and general feedback from the plugin screens, with an\";}s:3:\"pro\";a:24:{i:0;s:48:\"written, and can revise the snippets it created.\";i:1;s:8:\"restore.\";i:2;s:101:\"Display conditions for controlling where and when a snippet runs, without writing the checks by hand.\";i:3;s:105:\"Per-role snippet permissions, so you can decide which roles may view, edit, activate, or delete snippets.\";i:4;s:82:\"Blueprints for setting up a site from a saved collection of snippets and settings.\";i:5;s:112:\"Flat file storage, for keeping snippets as files so they can be version-controlled alongside the rest of a site.\";i:6;s:98:\"\"Ran on this page\" tracking, showing which snippets actually executed on the page you are viewing.\";i:7;s:107:\"Natural-language search in Community Cloud, so you can describe what you need instead of guessing keywords.\";i:8;s:18:\"display condition.\";i:9;s:71:\"Installing a cloud bundle onto a connected site as a standalone plugin.\";i:10;s:72:\"Updating Code Snippets Pro on a connected site from the cloud dashboard.\";i:11;s:105:\"Drift detection, which reports when a snippet on the site no longer matches the copy stored in the cloud.\";i:12;s:33:\"experience across plugin screens.\";i:13;s:96:\"Card view for browsing snippets, with a view switcher on the snippets table and Community Cloud.\";i:14;s:98:\"Snippet preview modal for viewing snippet code from the snippets table without opening the editor.\";i:15;s:88:\"Automatic hiding of unrelated admin notices from other plugins on Code Snippets screens.\";i:16;s:24:\"the WordPress admin bar.\";i:17;s:38:\"to https://github.com/mgiannopoulos24.\";i:18;s:22:\"names or descriptions.\";i:19;s:77:\"Bulk actions and bulk code download support in the redesigned snippets table.\";i:20;s:59:\"Featured snippets and improved browsing in Community Cloud.\";i:21;s:51:\"WordPress modern theme admin styling compatibility.\";i:22;s:16:\"upload controls.\";i:23;s:79:\"optional summary of the site environment so the team can reproduce the problem.\";}}s:7:\"Changed\";a:2:{s:4:\"core\";a:5:{i:0;s:110:\"Redesigned the main snippets table with improved search, filtering, sorting, pagination, row actions, and bulk\";i:1;s:115:\"Improved the snippet import and migration experience, including clearer file upload handling and third-party plugin\";i:2;s:117:\"Improved snippet error handling so activation failures, validation errors, and stack traces are easier to understand.\";i:3;s:118:\"Improved Community Cloud search and filtering, including server-side filters, better result loading, and clearer empty\";i:4;s:113:\"Improved accessibility across the snippets table, import screen, migration flow, Community Cloud, welcome screen,\";}s:3:\"pro\";a:9:{i:0;s:10:\"selection.\";i:1;s:16:\"migration flows.\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:7:\"states.\";i:4;s:104:\"Updated the welcome screen, toolbar, import screen, and cloud screens to match the new admin experience.\";i:5;s:103:\"Updated internal plugin architecture to a cleaner PSR-4 structure for better long-term maintainability.\";i:6;s:44:\"toolbar, dialogs, tooltips, and code editor.\";i:7;s:73:\"Improved colour contrast and reduced-motion support across admin screens.\";i:8;s:99:\"Faster loading of large code vaults, which are now fetched a page at a time instead of all at once.\";}}s:5:\"Fixed\";a:2:{s:3:\"pro\";a:11:{i:0;s:74:\"Fixed AI conversations from one connected site being visible from another.\";i:1;s:9:\"snippets.\";i:2;s:58:\"Fixed REST API server error responses on missing snippets.\";i:3;s:62:\"Fixed redundant frontend logic, improving overall performance.\";i:4;s:88:\"Fixed Community Cloud search results and pagination to respect WordPress screen options.\";i:5;s:93:\"Fixed snippet saving and activation feedback to improve validation and runtime error display.\";i:6;s:90:\"Fixed downloaded Community Cloud snippets appearing as not downloaded after a page reload.\";i:7;s:74:\"Fixed network snippet lookups using the wrong database table on multisite.\";i:8;s:61:\"Fixed the inactive snippets count including trashed snippets.\";i:9;s:86:\"Fixed featured Community Cloud snippets failing to load with some cloud API responses.\";i:10;s:0:\"\";}s:4:\"core\";a:11:{i:0;s:117:\"Fixed a snippet list stored in Code Snippets Cloud being emptied when the site was temporarily unable to read its own\";i:1;s:117:\"Fixed bulk actions in Community Cloud running against an empty selection, so selected snippets were never downloaded.\";i:2;s:82:\"Fixed a fatal error in the Elementor editor on Elementor versions older than 3.19.\";i:3;s:115:\"Fixed snippet descriptions staying truncated after the \"Truncate long snippet names and descriptions\" screen option\";i:4;s:17:\"was switched off.\";i:5;s:112:\"Fixed saving, activating or deactivating a snippet reporting its previous state, which could leave a deactivated\";i:6;s:43:\"snippet running under file-based execution.\";i:7;s:114:\"Fixed the snippet editor reporting a save as failed and undelivered when no response was received, which it cannot\";i:8;s:10:\"determine.\";i:9;s:115:\"Fixed translations being loaded too early, with a notice from WordPress, when posts were queried while plugins were\";i:10;s:14:\"still loading.\";}}}}i:1;a:3:{s:7:\"version\";s:6:\"3.10.2\";s:4:\"date\";s:17:\"September 1, 2026\";s:7:\"entries\";a:3:{s:5:\"Added\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:2:{i:0;s:112:\"Added a confirmation flow for run-once snippet execution and hardened the handler to prevent failed or confusing\";i:1;s:8:\"actions.\";}}s:7:\"Changed\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:2:{i:0;s:100:\"Snippet names now respect the row truncation Screen Option in the admin list for better readability.\";i:1;s:117:\"Version switching AJAX requests now validate the correct nonce, improving reliability when updating snippet versions.\";}}s:5:\"Fixed\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:6:{i:0;s:80:\"Fixed safe mode fatal errors caused by an undefined wp_get_current_user () call.\";i:1;s:82:\"Fixed PHP validation being triggered incorrectly when activating snippets in bulk.\";i:2;s:49:\"Fixed saving issues after a user session expires.\";i:3;s:82:\"Fixed warnings caused by aliased field names when reading modified snippet fields.\";i:4;s:76:\"Fixed vendor autoloader issues by stripping unprefixed namespace references.\";i:5;s:101:\"Resolved issues where snippet names and version switches could behave inconsistently in the admin UI.\";}}}}i:2;a:3:{s:7:\"version\";s:6:\"3.10.1\";s:4:\"date\";s:15:\"August 28, 2026\";s:7:\"entries\";a:2:{s:7:\"Changed\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:1:{i:0;s:73:\"Enhanced active-link visibility in the toolbar with border-based styling.\";}}s:5:\"Fixed\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:10:{i:0;s:81:\"Fixed a fatal error affecting snippets that use a namespace or declare statement.\";i:1;s:111:\"Fixed the snippets page rendering blank when another plugin\'s screen settings filter returned an invalid value.\";i:2;s:106:\"Fixed snippet saving on hosts that block REST API PUT and PATCH requests, by sending writes as POST with a\";i:3;s:16:\"method override.\";i:4;s:77:\"Fixed the Snippets List Order setting not being applied to the snippets list.\";i:5;s:101:\"Fixed admin bar snippet scripts failing to load on the free version, including on the site front end.\";i:6;s:71:\"Fixed snippet modified dates being sent without the correct UTC offset.\";i:7;s:70:\"Fixed the row truncation screen option not persisting across sessions.\";i:8;s:39:\"Fixed inconsistent sidebar label sizes.\";i:9;s:73:\"Fixed the sticky editor sidebar showing an unwanted horizontal scrollbar.\";}}}}i:3;a:3:{s:7:\"version\";s:6:\"3.10.0\";s:4:\"date\";s:15:\"August 24, 2026\";s:7:\"entries\";a:3:{s:5:\"Added\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:16:{i:0;s:108:\"New admin interface for managing snippets, with a cleaner layout, faster interactions, and a more consistent\";i:1;s:33:\"experience across plugin screens.\";i:2;s:96:\"Card view for browsing snippets, with a view switcher on the snippets table and Community Cloud.\";i:3;s:98:\"Snippet preview modal for viewing snippet code from the snippets table without opening the editor.\";i:4;s:88:\"Automatic hiding of unrelated admin notices from other plugins on Code Snippets screens.\";i:5;s:115:\"Admin bar snippet drawer, based on the Deckerweb Snippets workflow, for quick access to snippets and Safe Mode from\";i:6;s:24:\"the WordPress admin bar.\";i:7;s:89:\"Snippet locking to help prevent accidental edits or deletion of important snippets. Props\";i:8;s:38:\"to https://github.com/mgiannopoulos24.\";i:9;s:118:\"Improved screen options on the main snippets table, including controls for visible columns and truncating long snippet\";i:10;s:22:\"names or descriptions.\";i:11;s:77:\"Bulk actions and bulk code download support in the redesigned snippets table.\";i:12;s:59:\"Featured snippets and improved browsing in Community Cloud.\";i:13;s:51:\"WordPress modern theme admin styling compatibility.\";i:14;s:115:\"Clearer accessibility labels, headings, tab markup, table checkboxes, sort buttons, copy buttons, and drag-and-drop\";i:15;s:16:\"upload controls.\";}}s:7:\"Changed\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:12:{i:0;s:110:\"Redesigned the main snippets table with improved search, filtering, sorting, pagination, row actions, and bulk\";i:1;s:10:\"selection.\";i:2;s:115:\"Improved the snippet import and migration experience, including clearer file upload handling and third-party plugin\";i:3;s:16:\"migration flows.\";i:4;s:117:\"Improved snippet error handling so activation failures, validation errors, and stack traces are easier to understand.\";i:5;s:118:\"Improved Community Cloud search and filtering, including server-side filters, better result loading, and clearer empty\";i:6;s:7:\"states.\";i:7;s:104:\"Updated the welcome screen, toolbar, import screen, and cloud screens to match the new admin experience.\";i:8;s:103:\"Updated internal plugin architecture to a cleaner PSR-4 structure for better long-term maintainability.\";i:9;s:113:\"Improved accessibility across the snippets table, import screen, migration flow, Community Cloud, welcome screen,\";i:10;s:44:\"toolbar, dialogs, tooltips, and code editor.\";i:11;s:73:\"Improved colour contrast and reduced-motion support across admin screens.\";}}s:5:\"Fixed\";a:1:{s:4:\"core\";a:8:{i:0;s:58:\"Fixed REST API server error responses on missing snippets.\";i:1;s:62:\"Fixed redundant frontend logic, improving overall performance.\";i:2;s:88:\"Fixed Community Cloud search results and pagination to respect WordPress screen options.\";i:3;s:93:\"Fixed snippet saving and activation feedback to improve validation and runtime error display.\";i:4;s:90:\"Fixed downloaded Community Cloud snippets appearing as not downloaded after a page reload.\";i:5;s:74:\"Fixed network snippet lookups using the wrong database table on multisite.\";i:6;s:61:\"Fixed the inactive snippets count including trashed snippets.\";i:7;s:86:\"Fixed featured Community Cloud snippets failing to load with some cloud API responses.\";}}}}}}','off');
